  "preamble": "Fronting of the voiced postalveolar affricate [dʒ] to the alveolar affricate [dz]. Marathi has [dz] for the inherited Middle Indo-Aryan j (Maharashtri Prakrit ajja 'today' > आज /ad͡z/). Polish mazurzenie (dż [d͡ʐ] > dz) is filed under the retroflex cell ɖʐ → dz, not here.",
